{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/ILZDCQ-o_FKq5hUDJb3IDg","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:55.366284+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/ILZDCQ-o_FKq5hUDJb3IDg","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>为加强北京协和医学院生物医学工程一流学科建设，促进生物医学工程相关学科优秀大学生之间学习交流，中国医学科学院北京协和医学院生物医学工程研究所（以下简称“医工所”）拟定于</span><span>2026年7月中旬</span><span>举办</span><span>第九届全国优秀大学生暑期夏令营活动</span><span>，将带领同学们深入了解医工所科研平台体系建设，聆听专题报告，与专家开展线上学术交流。</span></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/NGD16Gn1haUAOljgqI0DBygF0txZNGEbJRoxZD9v7loUVrQyIlvmpoibibX6AXib09KFlXsoCvqqbrHBQ8ZZVRJMGaERoZx4gOI8JZ9COfvdag/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>单位简介</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>中国医学科学院北京协和医学院（以下简称“院校”）是我国现代医学教育的发源地，生物医学工程研究所是院校下属的科研院所之一，是生物医学工程专业领域最早成立的国家级研究所。医工所是北京协和医学院生物医学工程“一流学科”建设的主要承担单位，是国家生物医学工程专业博士、硕士培养点，设有生物医学工程博士后流动站。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>科学研究</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><span>医工所拥有国家级科研平台——先进医用材料与医疗器械全国重点实验室，调控组织器官再生医疗器械国家质量标准实验室，同时是呼吸与危重症诊疗技术与器械教育部工程研究中心、天津市医疗器械技术创新中心、天津市生物医学材料重点实验室、天津市神经调控与修复重点实验室、天津市医学电子诊疗技术工程中心以及中国医学科学院肿瘤免疫生物材料与纳米技术重点实验室的依托单位。</span></span></p><p><span><span>医工所主要从事生物医学工程新方法、新技术、新材料的研究与开发，涵盖两大科研领域：</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>（1）生物医学材料</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>主要研究方向：生物人工器官、再生医学、生物制造、组织修复材料、心血管生物材料、纳米生物材料、微纳机器人、免疫生物材料、跨屏障生物材料研究等。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>招生专业：</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>硕士：107200生物医学工程（材料学方向）、105500药学（专硕）</span></span></p><p><span><span>博士：083100生物医学工程（材料学方向）</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>（2）生物医学电子</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>主要研究方向：脑机接口、医学人工智能、神经调控与修复、医学影像、医学超声工程、医学信号检测与处理、激光医学、医用机器人研究等。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>招生专业：</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>硕士：083100生物医学工程（电子科学与技术方向）、085400电子信息（专硕）</span></span></p><p><span><span>博士：083100生物医学工程（电子科学与技术方向）</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>人才培养</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>医工所制定了详细的研究生人才培养方案，重视研究生综合素质培养，强化专业实践能力的锻炼和提升，与知名医疗器械企业共建研究生实践实习基地。毕业生多去往国内外名校继续深造、政府重要医技部门及进入迈瑞医疗、联影、华大基因、美敦力、西门子等国内外知名的医疗器械企业。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>04</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>助学保障与生活环境</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>医工所为在读研究生提供了优厚的奖助学金：硕士不低于2000元/月，博士不低于3250元/月，同时配有勤工助学金，成绩优异的同学可获得国家奖学金、学业奖学金、新生奖学金并享有优秀生源鼓励政策。医工所地理位置优越，处于天津“天开高教科创园”核心区，紧邻南开大学、天津大学、天津医科大学等知名高校，方便与周边高校学生进行交流与合作。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/NGD16Gn1haVjUEuJ3M92fCaCr7s8qUf4qjOdI9wXyddCpLBWD4iagoMvHM3Az9Bdf8XCTzV7AzsPeKsqQWyWHHHYxNao5mjVG4mz2EMic8MQs/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/NGD16Gn1haVgWfQBicUicCCkzrLEBdRZdgJMkzVHxfkVKsPG9iarXaXVllicyXK5uJiaKWrliaF6QicQoKwS9B1u1pqJcpuOmA5c0Q0UFS7wIeW1vQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/NGD16Gn1haX4AvPic9RHM2LLBIUhLicPYcOlCYTPMY1JwPK56iaKU5UWjGibiaEZyIW90jtRTxUrBHXVY3uuyxUsic4sTQDCOnvncKkgUq0s6ibYxU/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/NGD16Gn1haWjicwVUbhw7K0awazU9DsE9xLQJkNmKwQQFMjopQRULZLLvsm7EndW4giaO2EvBEMXDDzmzqXB2lnVm57TtAyKPW4eic6zClicHjc/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/NGD16Gn1haVOR54P7OK0pCdtY4x3eMYicESDneeia78edicOyYaCW19zqia8ZXibNZJ7dvA7MRxeTYSXmpL2WrdiamtYzRwtQn4daw90uQSxFM4Hk/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/NGD16Gn1haUibovbZsyanjt9fZMPkzzPzGBAQ1hrq5iaNV4AvL5aX6YsW5DGIWD6wZq5pribqDISOe5Ke6rCJdbsULSC46IkmUDMvnqiaU01Oe4/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/NGD16Gn1haXCNNrtaAz90ysszYcrdACrSA7lwd1TSOp97YibWVez923cZJiapsFWbpMtsZBQTas7LeKnGPjmhzSic7ibia1dsyIC1X5p91nCHNec/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>05</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请报名条件</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>（1）拥护中国共产党的领导，道德品质优良，遵纪守法、身心健康、在校期间未受过纪律处分。</span></p><p><span>（2）学习成绩优秀，对生物医学工程等相关学科有浓厚兴趣、有较强的科研潜力，且有志于报考北京协和医学院生物医学工程研究所攻读硕士或博士学位的2027年应届毕业生。</span></p><p><span>（3）英语水平满足下列条件之一者：全国大学英语四级≥450分、全国大学英语六级≥430分，雅思6.0分、托福80分及以上。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>06</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名及联系方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>（1）报名截止时间为6月30日</span></strong></span></p><p><span>申请参加夏令营活动的同学请于2026年6月30日前通过扫描下方二维码进行报名，逾期不予补报。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/NGD16Gn1haWZz3LvWPaeeJLKXSRefE3wleSsD7BhjoWbT4dOStIpLQUlEV0dZOfFDeZQ2a8jmCLFv6nQEAqXSSNvLudicBz9AUCRMBymcTBY/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>（2）材料初审时间为7月1日-7月7日</span></span></strong><span><br/></span></p><p><span>将根据申请者的学业水平、科研能力等，对申请者进行入围资格审查，向审查通过的同学发布夏令营具体日程表，未入营的同学不再另行通知。</span></p><p><strong><span><span>（3）活动咨询方式：</span></span></strong></p><p><span>联系人：张老师、孙老师、高老师、薛老师</span></p><p><span>联系电话：022-87890153</span></p><p><span>联系邮箱：bme015@pumc.edu.cn</span></p><p><span>生物医学工程研究所网址：</span></p><p><span>www.bme.org.cn</span></p><p><span>导师介绍链接：</span></p><p><span>https://www.bme.org.cn/yjsjy/dsjs/bssds/index.htm</span></p><p><span>地址：天津市南开区白堤路236号</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>来源：医科院生物医学工程研究所</span></p></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"dfbbb47b10cc0feaa2089cc2955c2527837bd3495b5074fc71c72e985f71e898","textLength":1650,"sourceSha256":"53e961d252224efc637732334129e0d3f0927e70ff415677200c8ed45bd9cc81","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-97aa7c5367e861022978","title":"2026年北京协和医学院生物医学工程研究所2026年全国优秀大学生暑期夏令营活动通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:55.366284+00:00"}
